*Data quality.* Five checks guard the data. (1) Independent hand calculations reproduce every healthy bias point and gain (<< m('hand_calcs.rows_ok') >> of << m('hand_calcs.rows_checked') >> within tolerance). (2) Fault behaviour is spot-checked by hand; this found the tube-model artifact, where a leakage resistor put an open-circuit cathode at half the plate voltage, fixed before any bar was set. (3) Stored units regenerate from their seeds, and the manifest ties every dataset to the code that produced it. (4) Complaint texts pass a leakage filter that rejects any text naming a part or a fault, and the paraphrases that test the complaint reader come from a separately written bank. (5) Ambiguity groups and symptom rates are reported per circuit, so a reader can see how often faults are indistinguishable or silent.

